===Etymology===
Reduplication of {{der|en|wrh|wagga||crow}}, where it pluralises the word.

Other translations have also attributed the word ''{{lang|wrh|wagga}}'' to mean 'reeling (like a sick man or a dizzy man)' to 'dance, slide or grind'.

